CM_ BO_ 864 "Haltech dash broadcast 0x360. 11-bit standard, big-endian, typically 1 Mbit/s. Start bits corrected to the DbcParserLib Motorola MSB convention (byteN -> N*8+7); the vendor Haltech_dash.dbc uses start=N*8 and decodes wrong here.";
CM_ SG_ 1136 Wideband_Overall "Overall wideband lambda. AFR (gasoline) = Lambda * 14.7.";
